DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45239::$$$message_0411_0000_0000$$$::"Is there really an onsen up ahead?"::
45240::$$$message_0411_0000_0001$$$::"There is. My intuition, or something like it, says so. I think."::
45241::$$$message_0411_0000_0002$$$::"Is intuition supposed to be that vague?"::
45242::$$$message_0411_0000_0003$$$::"Wait. There's someone up ahead."::
45243::$$$message_0411_0000_0004$$$::"Hm?"::
45244::$$$message_0411_0000_0005$$$::"Oh?"::
45245::$$$message_0411_0000_0006$$$::"Ah, ingredients."::
45246::$$$message_0411_0000_0007$$$::"Ahhh!"::
45247::$$$message_0411_0000_0008$$$::"I-Illya!?"::
45248::$$$message_0411_0000_0009$$$::"Wow, that hurts, kid. It's rude to scream just from seeing a guy's face."::
45249::$$$message_0411_0000_0010$$$::"I believe this is the kind of situation where you'd use the phrase, 'What would your parents think?'"::
45250::$$$message_0411_0000_0011$$$::"I-I'm sorry! It's just, uh...your face is scary..."::
45251::$$$message_0411_0000_0012$$$::"There is no need to worry, Ryunosuke."::
45252::$$$message_0411_0000_0013$$$::"Even if your facial structure causes children to emit shrill cries, I like it."::
45253::$$$message_0411_0000_0014$$$::"Thanks, big man. ...Hehe, you're making me blush."::
45254::$$$message_0411_0000_0015$$$::(He's not the one who made me scream, though!)::
45255::$$$message_0411_0000_0016$$$::"My...my intuition is now screaming that there is definitely something wrong with these guys!"::
45256::$$$message_0411_0000_0017$$$::"I feel like we've just run into the last people we should meet!"::
45257::$$$message_0411_0000_0018$$$::"Hey, big man. I've been wondering, what's up with that girl?"::
45258::$$$message_0411_0000_0019$$$::"Huh? M-me?"::
45259::$$$message_0411_0000_0020$$$::"She doesn't have color or a voice. Is she even alive?"::
45260::$$$message_0411_0000_0021$$$::"Ooh, a monochrome girl...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスター4th face=喜 pos=center time=300][hfsigh layer=2] I've never seen one before. Hehe. We're in luck, Ryunosuke."::
45261::$$$message_0411_0000_0022$$$::"Eh? Huh?"::
45262::$$$message_0411_0000_0023$$$::"What a rare find! I'm looking forward to seeing if her innards are also black and white...!"::
45263::$$$message_0411_0000_0024$$$::"W-what's with these guys!?":��K